  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Muneshwers Limited Port and Warehouse Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The operation consists of a secured A-loan of up to US$26 million with a repayment term of up to ten years to support the expansion of Muneshwers Limited through the acquisition of three (3) gantry cranes and the construction of a hardware store and warehouse. This will allow Muneshwers Limited to improve its operations and accompany Guyana&apos;s economic growth.</narrative>
  </description>
